"earthobservatory.nasa.gov/Newsroom/BlueMarble/\">http://earthobservatory."
"nasa.gov/Newsroom/BlueMarble/</a></p>"

#: src/lib/marble/MarbleAboutDialog.cpp:222
msgid ""
